export anchor BoardroomWalnutStyle:
    number: 342
    screen: CrmPipeline
    name: Boardroom walnut
    idea: The pipeline laid out on a dark walnut boardroom table, each stage a stitched leather folder with a brass name plate, owners on small engraved brass plates, the figures on brass plaques and the activity as minutes on a green leather blotter.
    base: dark
    palette:
        walnut: #26170f, the table top, with grain lines in #2d1c13 and #21140d
        sheetWalnut: #1c110b, the style sheet ground
        oxblood: #3b1d1b, open stage folders and the secondary button
        bottleGreen: #1d2c24, the Won folder and the minutes blotter
        stitch: #b08a5a, dashed stitching inside every folder
        ink: #f1e3c8, text on leather and wood
        tan: #d2b994, italic remarks and labels
        brassLight: #e6c983, the top of every brass gradient and focus
        brass: #c9a45c, plaques, name plates and the primary button
        brassDark: #b8924a, the bottom of the brass gradient
        engraved: #2a1a08, text cut into brass
        red: #ffa08c, Stalled with a triangle
        leaf: #b7e0a0, Closed with a check
    type:
        A book serif, Baskerville, Baskerville Old Face, Hoefler Text,
        Garamond, Times New Roman, with plates in Copperplate, Copperplate
        Gothic Light, Trajan Pro, Optima. Base 17px. The header plate is
        24px uppercase at 600 tracked .12em, plaque figures 28px at 600,
        deal names 18px at 600, values 22px, owner plates 11px uppercase,
        remarks 15px italic.
    layout:
        The page is walnut grain drawn with fine repeating lines. A brass
        header plate reads Brightwork Sales over Q4 Pipeline, with a
        stitched oxblood Owners button and a brass New deal button. Five
        brass plaques with two screw dots each show the figures in dark
        engraved text, the won plaque with a dark bar at 64 percent. Five
        leather folders follow, each with a tab at the top left, a dashed
        stitch line inside and a brass name plate with the stage and count.
        Deals are blocks with the name, a large value, a brass owner plate
        and an italic remark, split by thin tan rules, and a Folder total
        line closes each folder. Won is bottle green. A green blotter with
        wooden end strips holds Minutes as a numbered list. Below 1100px
        folders go three across, on phones one across with plaques two by
        two.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 18px between folders, 14px between plaques, 12px inside the stitching, 28px gutter, 16px on phones.
    density: Low to medium. Five folders with generous wood between.
    corners: Folders 4px at the tab corner and 12px elsewhere, 8px stitching, 2px to 4px on brass.
    borders: Dashed 1.5px tan stitching inside folders and the blotter, thin tan rules between deals, wooden ends on the blotter.
    shadows: Deep soft shadows under folders and blotter, an inner shade on leather, a light top bevel and a short drop on brass.
    icons:
        Few small line icons at 1.7 stroke beside italic remarks. A red
        triangle with the word in bold for stalled, a leaf check for closed.
    focus: A 3px light brass outline offset 3px.
    tone: Formal meeting words, such as Q4 Pipeline, Folder total, Minutes and Owners.
